WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
You don't need 5 tracking apps.

2
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:02.900
One sentence does it.

3
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:06.300
Typed to Fern: "spent 12 on lunch, bench 3x8 at 60kg, remind me to submit the budget draft at 5"

4
00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:09.500
Fern logged three things: an expense of $12.00 for food, bench 3 × 8 at 60 kg, and a task due 17:00. Each has Undo.

5
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:11.500
Asked Fern: "how much on food this week?"

6
00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:13.500
Fern: $86 since Monday, $14 more than last week. Wednesday was the biggest day.

7
00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:17.000
Say it. It's tracked. Just tell Fern.
